      "writtenOn": "2022-06-22T03:18:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We have the config name in a couple of threads, but just wanted to follow up here to say that for readability it is definitely better to have positive name like you suggested than the negative name (`DISABLE`) that I suggested: http://go/tott/530.",
